      <h2>What to Do If the Other Person Pressures You</h2>

      <p>Pressure can take different forms, from repeatedly asking for personal information to insisting that you meet, send money, move to another service, or make a decision before you are comfortable. You do not need to continue a conversation simply because it started positively.</p>

